{"id":"bb349293c3ea3e69","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-thm-suslin-tree-construction.md","title":"Suslin Tree Construction","display":"thm-suslin-tree-construction — Suslin Tree Construction","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-suslin-tree-construction","aliases":["58-thm-suslin-tree-construction","Suslin Tree Construction","Jech Suslin Tree"],"display":"thm-suslin-tree-construction — Suslin Tree Construction","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-diamond.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-suslin-tree-construction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-suslin-tree-construction</span><span>Suslin Tree Construction</span><span>Jech Suslin Tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-suslin-tree-construction — Suslin Tree Construction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d60e0a36bd259287\" href=\"?note=d60e0a36bd259287\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-diamond.md\">../batch20/58-df-diamond.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"47ecd1e17d0a4400\" href=\"?note=47ecd1e17d0a4400\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md\">../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,&lt;_T\\in V\">\\(T,&lt;_T\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_T\\subseteq T^2\">\\(&lt;_T\\subseteq T^2\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond\\leftrightarrow\\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}\">\\(\\Diamond\\leftrightarrow\\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}\\)</span> is the diamond principle from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d60e0a36bd259287\" href=\"?note=d60e0a36bd259287\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-diamond.md\">../batch20/58-df-diamond.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SuslinTree}(T,&lt;_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{SuslinTree}(T,&lt;_T)\\)</span> is the fully parameterized Suslin-tree predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"47ecd1e17d0a4400\" href=\"?note=47ecd1e17d0a4400\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md\">../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}suslin\\text{-}tree\\text{-}construction} \\vdash\n\\Diamond\\to\\exists T,&lt;_T\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(&lt;_T\\subseteq T^2\\land\\mathrm{SuslinTree}(T,&lt;_T)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}suslin\\text{-}tree\\text{-}construction} \\vdash\n\\Diamond\\to\\exists T,&lt;_T\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(&lt;_T\\subseteq T^2\\land\\mathrm{SuslinTree}(T,&lt;_T)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}\">\\(\\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}\\)</span> is sufficient but not necessary for a Suslin tree.</li>\n<li>The separate implication <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=L\\Rightarrow\\Diamond\">\\(V=L\\Rightarrow\\Diamond\\)</span> requires a formal constructibility/class-semantics theorem and is not folded into this assertion.</li>\n<li>The constructions proceed by recursion on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>, controlling potential branches and antichains.</li>\n<li>Aronszajn trees already exist in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span>, but the Suslin requirement is stronger.</li>\n<li>Aronszajn tree: exists in ZFC.</li>\n<li>Suslin tree: requires extra axioms or fails under MA.</li>\n<li>Applications: SH independence proof, tree combinatorics.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-diamond.md","status":"resolved","id":"d60e0a36bd259287","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-diamond.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"47ecd1e17d0a4400","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-diamond.md","status":"resolved","id":"d60e0a36bd259287","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Diamond\\leftrightarrow\\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}$ is the diamond principle from [[../batch20/58-df-diamond.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"47ecd1e17d0a4400","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SuslinTree}(T,<_T)$ is the fully parameterized Suslin-tree predicate from [[../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,<_T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"<_T\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond\\leftrightarrow\\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SuslinTree}(T,<_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}suslin\\text{-}tree\\text{-}construction} \\vdash\n\\Diamond\\to\\exists T,<_T\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(<_T\\subseteq T^2\\land\\mathrm{SuslinTree}(T,<_T)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}","display":false},{"tex":"V=L\\Rightarrow\\Diamond","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}","display":false}],"bytes":1499,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4453","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"ex